ck Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  07 MAY 98 at 14 14 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number only  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 3cm piece of firm breast tissue inked and sectioned to reveal tan white firm cut surface  A representative section is frozen as FX  1 and resubmitted in cassette A  Representative section of the rest is submitted in cassettes B through F  Resident  STEPHEN LAU  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1   RIGHT BREAST BIOPSY   INVASIVE CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  STUART HOUSER  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Eugene F  Ruffolo  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , Unchecked.
