efined mass which is grossly focally present at the anterior margin and 0 2cm from the posterior margin  Representative sections are submitted in cassettes S through W from lateral to medial margin   S is the most lateral section  W is the most lateral margin  T through V are representative sections of the ill defined mass in relationship to the anterior and posterior margin   Received in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number are two additional specimens Labeled  left breast mass  additional superficial margins  are multiple fragments of fatty adipose tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm in aggregate  The specimens are submitted entirely in cassettes X and Y  Labeled  left breast  final shaved margins  are multiple fragments of fibroadipose tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm in aggregate  The specimens are submitted entirely in cassettes Z through CC  Resident  HONGMEI LI  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  RIGHT BREAST   NO AREA SUSPICIOUS FOR INVASIVE CARCINOMA  GROSS DIAGNOSIS  LEFT BREAST   2 CM INFILTRATING CARCINOMA FOCALLY PRESENT AT ANTERIOR MARGINS REMOVED_DATE CM FROM POSTERIOR MARGIN  O R  Resident  LISA A  GALLAGHER  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Eugene F  Ruffolo  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISION PART B  BREAST  RIGHT  ADDITIONAL SUPERIOR MARGIN  PART C  BREAST  RIGHT  FINAL SHAVED MARGIN  PART D  BREAST  LEFT   EXCISION PART E  BREAST  LEFT  ADDITIONAL SUPERIOR MARGIN  PART F  BREAST  LEFT  FINAL SHAVED MARGIN  , Unchecked.
