y cavity has a focal tan  smooth lining with areas of hemorrhage  Within the breast specimen are multiple foci of white tan unremarkable breast parenchyma  The axillary tail is not present and no lymph nodes are identified  There are no irregular  fibrous  gritty nodules within the breast tissue  Section code  A  lateral margin B  medial margin C  inferior margin D  superior margin E G  deep margin with biopsy cavity H J  representative sections of biopsy cavity K O  random breast tissue P  nipple Gross Description by  SCOTT O  URBAN  HMS Resident  Mark vanGorder  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT    report_end  , Unchecked.
