ity to the overlying skin  The remainder of the breast parenchyma is mainly fatty and grossly unremarkable  SECTION CODE A C  cavity  relation to deep margin  D  cavity  relation to overlying skin  E  cavity  relation to inferior  F G  cavity  H I  tissue adjacent to cavity  relation to deep margin  J  distant normal looking breast parenchyma  Resident  LAURENCE DE LEVAL  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  Irene Kuter  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , Unchecked.
